cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hotspot3d: gene-independent 3D spatial hotspot and footprint pipeline for pathogenic missense variants"
abstract: >-
  hotspot3d takes an HGNC gene symbol, retrieves the ClinVar missense record and
  the AlphaFold structure for its MANE Select transcript, and tests whether
  pathogenic missense variants cluster in three-dimensional space more than the
  structure itself would produce by chance under a structure-aware positional
  null. Significant hotspot centres are delimited, a geometric footprint is
  built around them, that footprint is stress-tested against centre
  perturbation, and the surviving regions are annotated with curated
  functional-mechanism evidence. The methodology is frozen and pre-registered;
  no step branches on a specific gene or protein.
